  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El PSPV-PSOE de Onda ha celebrado la tarde de este jueves en el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura un acto de precampa&ntilde;a para las elecciones europeas, en el que han intervenido el secretario general de la agrupaci&oacute;n local, Ximo Huguet Lecha, su hom&oacute;logo en la comarca de la Plana Baixa, Juan Miguel Salvador P&eacute;rez, y el vicesecretario general del PSPV-PSOE y portavoz de su comi&acute;te electoral, Francesc Romeu Mart&iacute;.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6106.jpg\" alt=\"img_6106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6107.jpg\" alt=\"img_6107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6111.jpg\" alt=\"img_6111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6115.jpg\" alt=\"img_6115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6116.jpg\" alt=\"img_6116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6117.jpg\" alt=\"img_6117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6119.jpg\" alt=\"img_6119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeprecampanyaeleccionseuropees/img_6